OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe odd shower is possible over
OL,6,Fnorthern Argyll at first, but
OL,7,Fotherwise it will be a dry day with
OL,8,Fvariable cloud and long sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry and settled night with
OL,12,Fmostly cloudy skies, though some clear
OL,13,Fintervals are possible. Winds
OL,14,Fstrengthening around coastal areas of
OL,15,FArgyll, but lighter winds inland where
OL,16,Fa little chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
