OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA dry and mostly cloudy
OL,6,Fmorning with some brightness. Cloud
OL,7,Flowering and becoming thicker in the
OL,8,Fafternoon with some light rain
OL,9,Fpossible. Winds strengthening, with
OL,10,Fcoastal gales possible in west.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,13,FWednesday with strong winds and heavy
OL,14,Frain spreading east, dry and clear
OL,15,Flater. Mostly dry with sunny spells
OL,16,FThursday and winds easing. Cloudy
OL,17,FFriday with rain spreading east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
